    {
      "name": "Silent Threshold Pounce",
      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "F1F9WnnFOlHvuc8k",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>While Hidden, mark a Stress and choose a target within Very Close range. The Cougar skips into Melee range as it attacks. The target must make an Agility or Instinct Reaction Roll (15). On a failure, they take 2d8 physical damage, become Vulnerable, and become Silenced until the end of their next action. On a success, they take half damage and do not become Silenced or Vulnerable. Silenced: The target cannot speak, shout warnings, or otherwise produce intentional vocal sound. This does not prevent physical actions, movement, or non-vocal communication.</p>",
